{"status":"ok","message-type":"work","message-version":"1.0.0","message":{"indexed":{"date-parts":[[2026,4,13]],"date-time":"2026-04-13T12:17:17Z","timestamp":1776082637104,"version":"3.50.1"},"reference-count":33,"publisher":"Cambridge University Press (CUP)","issue":"6","license":[{"start":{"date-parts":[[2015,10,27]],"date-time":"2015-10-27T00:00:00Z","timestamp":1445904000000},"content-version":"unspecified","delay-in-days":0,"URL":"https:\/\/www.cambridge.org\/core\/terms"}],"content-domain":{"domain":["www.cambridge.org"],"crossmark-restriction":true},"short-container-title":["Acta Neuropsychiatr."],"published-print":{"date-parts":[[2015,12]]},"abstract":"<jats:sec id=\"S0924270815000290_abs1\" sec-type=\"general\"><jats:title>Objective<\/jats:title><jats:p>Heat stroke is a medical emergency. Psychiatric patients are particularly susceptible to heat stroke. Therefore, awareness and preventive measures of heat stroke are important for both clinicians and patients.<\/jats:p><\/jats:sec><jats:sec id=\"S0924270815000290_abs2\" sec-type=\"general\"><jats:title>Case description<\/jats:title><jats:p>A 49-year-old man with schizophrenia, who was under maintenance treatment with olanzapine 20 mg<jats:italic>\/<\/jats:italic>day, trihexyphenidyl 4 mg<jats:italic>\/<\/jats:italic>day, and trazodone 50 mg<jats:italic>\/<\/jats:italic>day, suffered from heat stroke in a heat wave and required intensive care. He recovered with the medical treatment provided.<\/jats:p><\/jats:sec><jats:sec id=\"S0924270815000290_abs3\" sec-type=\"discussion\"><jats:title>Discussion<\/jats:title><jats:p>Several factors could have contributed to the impaired thermoregulation and the occurrence of heat stroke in this case: schizophrenia, the psychotropic regimen, and lack of preventive measures. Possible differential diagnoses of heat stroke in this case include infection, neuroleptic malignant syndrome, and serotonin syndrome.<\/jats:p><\/jats:sec><jats:sec id=\"S0924270815000290_abs4\" sec-type=\"conclusion\"><jats:title>Conclusion<\/jats:title><jats:p>Heat stroke can occur during the maintenance treatment of olanzapine, trihexyphenidyl, and trazodone for schizophrenia. Clinicians should be proactive to reduce the risk of heat stroke in psychiatric patients.<\/jats:p><\/jats:sec>","DOI":"10.1017\/neu.2015.29","type":"journal-article","created":{"date-parts":[[2015,10,27]],"date-time":"2015-10-27T19:29:17Z","timestamp":1445974157000},"page":"380-385","update-policy":"https:\/\/doi.org\/10.1017\/policypage","source":"Crossref","is-referenced-by-count":14,"title":["Heat stroke during treatment with olanzapine, trihexyphenidyl, and trazodone in a patient with schizophrenia"],"prefix":"10.1017","volume":"27","author":[{"given":"Chin-Pang","family":"Lee","sequence":"first","affiliation":[],"role":[{"role":"author","vocabulary":"crossref"}]},{"given":"Pei-Jung","family":"Chen","sequence":"additional","affiliation":[],"role":[{"role":"author","vocabulary":"crossref"}]},{"given":"Chia-Ming","family":"Chang","sequence":"additional","affiliation":[],"role":[{"role":"author","vocabulary":"crossref"}]}],"member":"56","published-online":{"date-parts":[[2015,10,27]]},"reference":[{"key":"S0924270815000290_ref20","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1017\/CBO9780511546013"},{"key":"S0924270815000290_ref22","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1001\/archinte.167.20.ira70009"},{"key":"S0924270815000290_ref21","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1001\/jama.1982.03320490030031"},{"key":"S0924270815000290_ref9","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1155\/2012\/924328"},{"key":"S0924270815000290_ref25","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1177\/0091270011409233"},{"key":"S0924270815000290_ref30","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1016\/S0278-5846(02)00202-6"},{"key":"S0924270815000290_ref32","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1093\/schbul\/sbr202"},{"key":"S0924270815000290_ref31","doi-asserted-by":"crossref","first-page":"1137","DOI":"10.1176\/ajp.1